@startuml SEQ_11_REVIEW_PERMOHONAN_PENGADAAN_KALAB
!theme plain
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam TitleFontSize 14
title Sequence Diagram — SEQ-11: Mereview Permohonan Pengadaan (Kalab)

actor       "Kalab"                    as Kalab
boundary    "Browser"                  as Browser
control     "InventarisController" as Controller
entity      "PermohonanAset Model"     as ModelPA
entity      "WishlistAset Model"       as ModelWA

== Lihat Permohonan Menunggu Review ==

Kalab   -> Browser     : Buka menu Permohonan Pengadaan
Browser --> Kalab : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : GET /inventaris/permohonan
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelPA  : Query permohonan menunggu review Kalab
ModelPA --> Controller : Data permohonan
Controller --> Browser : Render halaman
Browser --> Kalab      : Tampilkan daftar permohonan

== Review Permohonan ==

Kalab   -> Browser     : Kirim hasil review
Browser --> Kalab : response / redirect
Browser -> Controller  : POST /inventaris/permohonan/{id}/review-kalab {hasil_review, catatan}
Controller --> Browser : response / redirect
Controller -> ModelPA  : update status review Kalab
ModelPA --> Controller : Hasil query
Controller -> ModelWA  : Sinkronkan status wishlist_aset
ModelWA --> Controller : Hasil proses
Controller --> Browser : Redirect + notifikasi sukses
Browser --> Kalab      : Status review tersimpan

@enduml